   "h": 894,
   "text": "Annie was peeking into her pocket. \"What is in your pocket?\" asked Tess. \"Come and see,\" said Annie. Tess looked in Annie's pocket. Jen and David looked, too. \"It's my new pet gecko,\" Annie said. \"He is cute,\" said Jen.",
   "textBox": null,
   "wordBoxes": null,
   "audio": [
    1.06,
    3.38
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "image": "books/G1/089/p05.jpg",
   "w": 1400,
   "h": 894,
   "text": "\"He is cute,\" said David. \"But you can't have a pet in school.\" \"Mrs. Peck will get mad,\" said Jen. \"I just had to bring him,\" Annie said. \"He is so much fun. He is the best pet ever! And he can run really fast.\"",
   "textBox": null,
   "wordBoxes": null,
   "audio": [
    9.28,
    11.17
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "image": "books/G1/089/p06.jpg",
   "w": 1400,
   "h": 894,
   "text": "Just then, the gecko showed them how fast he could run. He ran down Annie's arm. He ran down Annie's leg. Then he ran across the floor. \"Stop that gecko!\" Annie yelled. The kids tried to catch the gecko. But the little gecko was too fast. He ran out of the room. Annie and her friends ran after him.",
   "textBox": null,
   "wordBoxes": null,
   "audio": [
    12.36,
    16.0
